{"type":"standard","title":"Brandon Herrera","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Brandon Herrera</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q131549488","titles":{"canonical":"Brandon_Herrera","normalized":"Brandon Herrera","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Brandon Herrera</span></span>"},"pageid":78312187,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Brandon_Herrera_with_attendees_%2855457704523%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Brandon_Herrera_with_attendees_%2855457704523%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":440},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/Brandon_Herrera_with_attendees_%2855457704523%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1455,"height":1939},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1377292415","tid":"b8b79b5e-bb6f-11f1-a193-091d7b315350","timestamp":"2026-09-28T19:06:34Z","description":"American YouTuber and political candidate (born 1995)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brandon_Herrera","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brandon_Herrera?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brandon_Herrera?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Brandon_Herrera"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brandon_Herrera","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Brandon_Herrera","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brandon_Herrera?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Brandon_Herrera"}},"extract":"Brandon Joseph Herrera, also known as The AK Guy, is an American YouTuber, firearms manufacturer, and political candidate. He gained prominence through his YouTube channel, launched in 2014, which features firearms testing, historical weapon demonstrations, and commentary on gun policy and politics. Herrera is a member of the Republican Party.","extract_html":"<p><b>Brandon Joseph Herrera</b>, also known as <b>The AK Guy</b>, is an American YouTuber, firearms manufacturer, and political candidate. He gained prominence through his YouTube channel, launched in 2014, which features firearms testing, historical weapon demonstrations, and commentary on gun policy and politics. Herrera is a member of the Republican Party.</p>"}